data: {"type":"agent_chunk","agent":"critic","content":"- **Missing safety and delivery:** The review covers mechanism and early results but omits off-target cutting, immune responses, and how edits reach target tissues. Without these, the therapeutic section overstates readiness.\n- **Thin therapeutic sourcing:** The 2021 \"many diseases\" claim rests on one headline source and names no disease, trial, or outcome. Treat it as hype unless backed by clinical data.\n- **Unsupported toolkit comparison:** Zinc finger nucleases and TALENs are listed from a single source, with no comparison of precision, cost, or use cases relative to CRISPR."}

